  m_Name: EconomicHearMore01
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  hearMoreName: EconomicHearMore01
  hearMoreText: "Economic sustainability in software means building systems that
    remain financially healthy without sacrificing long-term stability or fairness.
    It\u2019s about more than just cutting costs \u2014 it\u2019s about ensuring
    that investments in development, maintenance, and support create lasting value.
    Sustainable software avoids short-term decisions that may seem efficient but
    lead to higher expenses and reduced flexibility later. "
